 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2026 年 2 月 15 日，Base 链上的借贷协议 Moonwell，执行了一份治理提案。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 2 月 15 日，Base 链上的借贷协议 Moonwell，执行了一份治理提案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 1.702,
   "speechEnd": 7.539
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "提案生效后，cbETH 的美元价格，只用了 cbETH 对 ETH 的汇率。",
   "spoken": "提案生效后，cbETH 的美元价格，只用了 cbETH 对 ETH 的汇率。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-01.wav",
   "start": 7.98,
   "dur": 9.52,
   "speechStart": 7.98,
   "speechEnd": 17.308
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "它把一个汇率，当成了美元价格。",
   "spoken": "它把一个汇率，荡成了美元价格。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-02.wav",
   "start": 17.72,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 17.72,
   "speechEnd": 20.323
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "一枚约 2200 美元的 cbETH，在合约眼里，只值约 1.12 美元。",
   "spoken": "一枚约 2200 美元的 cbETH，在合约眼里，只值约 1.12 美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-03.wav",
   "start": 20.74,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 20.833,
   "speechEnd": 28.818
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "清算机器人立刻动手，清算了约 1096 枚 cbETH。",
   "spoken": "清算机器人立刻动手，清算了约 1096 枚 cbETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-04.wav",
   "start": 29.28,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 29.28,
   "speechEnd": 34.571
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "按 The Block 的报道，协议留下约 178 万美元坏账。",
   "spoken": "按 The Block 的报道，协议留下约 178 万美元坏账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-05.wav",
   "start": 34.94,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 35.041,
   "speechEnd": 39.524
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-06.wav",
   "start": 39.96,
   "dur": 1.04,
   "speechStart": 39.96,
   "speechEnd": 40.761
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "这个价格大于 0，而且刚刚更新过。",
   "spoken": "这个价格大于 0，而且刚刚更新过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-07.wav",
   "start": 41.22,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 41.316,
   "speechEnd": 44.396
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "只检查正值和时效，能拦住它吗？",
   "spoken": "只检查正值和时效，能拦住它吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-08.wav",
   "start": 44.8,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speechStart": 44.8,
   "speechEnd": 47.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "不能。两项检查，都会通过。",
   "spoken": "不能。两项检查，都会通过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-09.wav",
   "start": 48.34,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 48.436,
   "speechEnd": 50.895
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "价格是新的，也是错的。",
   "spoken": "价格是新的，也是错的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-10.wav",
   "start": 51.36,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 51.36,
   "speechEnd": 53.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "合约读到的价格，可能被推高，可能停住，也可能配错。",
   "spoken": "合约读到的价格，可能被推高，可能停住，也可能配错。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-11.wav",
   "start": 53.98,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 53.98,
   "speechEnd": 59.572
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "问题是，错的时候，哪一行代码来拦住它。",
   "spoken": "问题是，错的时候，哪一航代码来拦住它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep08/audio/lines/seg1-12.wav",
   "start": 59.96,
   "dur": 3.68,
